    "title": "Reading a Flowchart",
    "long_instructions": "![Flowchart: Start, move forward, turn left, move forward, End.](https://images.code.org/9f096f527cf0af4ff321dad14eddbfa0-Screenshot 2026-10-15 211015.png)\r\nThe robot starts on a grid facing north.\r\n1. Write the steps of this flowchart in order.\r\n2. Describe the trail the robot draws.",
