    "stay_on_level_after_submit": "false",
    "teacher_markdown": "- **Answer.**\r\n  Steps: 1. move forward, 2. turn left, 3. move forward. The robot draws an L: one square up, then one square to the left.\r\n\r\n- **Look for one step per box, in order.**\r\n  If students skip a box or combine two steps, ask them to point to each box in the flowchart as they write.\r\n\r\n- **Check the turn direction.**\r\n  If students say the trail bends right, they likely turned relative to the page instead of the robot. Ask them to turn their body to face the way the robot faces.\r\n\r\n- **Accept any clear description of the trail.**\r\n  Words (\"up one, then left one\") or a sketch both work."
  },
